<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>라벨</title>
    <style>
                  @page {
                    size: <%= labelSize === 'large' ? '100mm 100mm' : labelSize === 'medium' ? '80mm 60mm' : '50mm 30mm' %>;
                    margin: 0;
                  }
                  body {
                    margin: 0;
                    padding: 0;
                    font-family: 'Nanum Gothic', sans-serif;
                    justify-content: center;
                    align-items: center;
                    height: 100%;
                  }
                  .label-content {
              width: 100%;
              height: 100%;
              justify-content: center; /* 수평 중앙 */
              align-items: center;     /* 수직 중앙 */
              text-align: center;
            }

                  h1, h3, p {
                    margin: 2px 0;
                  }
                  h3 {
                    transform: rotate(270deg); /* 90도 회전 */
                    transform-origin: center center; /* 회전 중심점 지정 (기본값) */
                  }
                  img.barcode {
                    max-width: 90%;
                    max-height: 50%;
                    margin-top: 4px;
                  }
                  .barcode-text {
                    font-size: 6pt;
                  }
                  .small-label {
                    display: flex;
                    flex-flow: column;
                  }
                  .small-label-container {
                    display: flex;
                    flex-flow: column;
                  }
                  .medium-label {
                    margin-top: 5rem;
        display: flex;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="label-content">
      <% if (labelSize === 'large') { %>
      <h1><%= productName %></h1>
      <p>제조일자: <%= manufactureDate %></p>
      <p>유통기한: <%= expiryDate %></p>
      <p>등록번호: 제III RAX0009호</p>
      <p>성분량: 조단백질 36% 이상...</p>
      <p>주의사항: 반려동물 이외에는 급여하지 마십시오.</p>
      <img
        class="barcode"
        src="data:image/png;base64,<%= barcodeBase64 %>"
        alt="Barcode"
      />
      <% } else if (labelSize === 'medium') { %>
      <div class="medium-label">
        <h3><%= productName %></h3>
        <img
          class="barcode"
          src="data:image/png;base64,<%= barcodeBase64 %>"
          alt="Barcode"
        />
      </div>
      <% } else if (labelSize === 'small') { %>
      <div class="small-label-container">
        <div class="small-lable">
          <p>제 조 날 짜</p>
          <p><%= manufactureDate.split('').join(' ') %></p>
        </div>
        <div class="small-lable">
          <p>유 통 기 한</p>
          <p><%= expiryDate.split('').join(' ') %></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
